cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pyWellSFM: Python Well Stratigraphic Forward Modeling"
abstract: >-
  pyWellSFM simulates the deposition of sedimentary layers over time along
  one or multiple wells. Deposition is controlled by the accommodation space
  (eustatism and subsidence) and by an accumulation model (Gaussian or
  environment optimum).
authors:
  - family-names: Lemay
    given-names: Martin
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5538-7885"
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/martin-lemay/pyWellSFM"
url: "https://pywellsfm.readthedocs.io/en/latest/"
keywords:
  - stratigraphic forward modeling
  - sedimentology
  - stratigraphy
  - well
